---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Stack Discover — AI Opportunity Discovery | Stack10"
  description="Stack Discover maps your actual processes from live data before recommending anything. Give your board a defensible AI strategy — built on evidence, not assumptions."
  canonicalUrl="https://www.stack10.ai/services/discover/"
>

  <!-- ── HERO ──────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <section class="svc-hero hero-dark">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="svc-hero-inner animate-fade-up">
        <span class="section-label svc-hero-label">Stack Discover</span>
        <h1 class="svc-hero-title">Give your board a defensible AI strategy — built on your data, not assumptions.</h1>
        <p class="svc-hero-subtitle">Before a line of code is written, Stack Discover maps what's actually happening inside your operations — live system data and the people running them. Two to eight weeks depending on depth.</p>
        <div class="svc-hero-actions">
          <a href="/contact/" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">
            Get Started
            <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 17L17 7"/><path d="M7 7h10v10"/></svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ── PAIN SECTION ──────────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <section class="section section-pain">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="svc-pain-inner">
        <p class="svc-pain-text">Your board wants an AI roadmap. Your last proof of concept failed — and you know what it costs to back the wrong project twice. Most consultants run a workshop, interview your team, and hand you a deck built on what people told them. We don't. We connect to your live systems — process mining, real data, no assumptions.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ── DIFFERENTIATOR ────────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <section class="section section-muted">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="svc-diff-grid">
        <div class="svc-diff-copy">
          <span class="section-label">How we work</span>
          <h2 class="section-title">We map your processes before we recommend anything.</h2>
          <p class="section-desc">Most consultants interview people and guess. We connect to your live systems — ERP, CRM, HRIS — and use process mining to see exactly where time is lost, where errors compound, and where AI will actually deliver ROI. No assumptions. No slide-deck strategy you can't defend. The process baseline we establish here is what powers every 30, 60, and 90-day accountability checkpoint across Build and Scale.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="svc-diff-stat-group">
          <div class="svc-diff-stat card">
            <span class="svc-diff-stat-number">2–3 FTE</span>
            <p class="svc-diff-stat-label">analytics capacity redeployed from manual reporting — PE-backed healthcare group, 50 practices, $111M revenue. The opportunity only surfaced when we mapped what the team was actually doing, not what they said they were doing.</p>
          </div>
          <p class="svc-diff-attribution">This opportunity didn't come from an interview. It surfaced when we mined their actual workflows — the gap between what their systems showed and what their team assumed.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ── HOW WE APPROACH IT ───────────────────────────────────── -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <span class="section-label">Our approach</span>
        <h2 class="section-title">Two ways we work — one right for your situation</h2>
        <p class="section-desc">We recommend the right approach after an initial conversation. Scope and depth are tailored to your organisation — most engagements sit somewhere between the two.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="approach-grid">

        <div class="card approach-card">
          <div class="approach-header">
            <span class="approach-tag">Interview &amp; Survey-Led</span>
            <p class="approach-context">Best for organisations at the start of their AI journey, or when you need a board-ready strategy without waiting for system integrations. Fast to mobilise.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="approach-body">
            <div class="approach-section">
              <span class="label-mono">How we work</span>
              <ul class="approach-list">
                <li>Executive and stakeholder interviews across departments</li>
                <li>Process walkthroughs and workflow documentation</li>
                <li>Survey-based opportunity scanning across the organisation</li>
                <li>ROI modelling from operational data gathered through interviews and process walkthroughs</li>
                <li>Effort vs impact scoring across all identified opportunities — ranked on a 5-point scale so the highest-impact, lowest-effort items surface first</li>
              </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="approach-section">
              <span class="label-mono">What you receive</span>
              <ul class="approach-list approach-list-deliverables">
                <li>Prioritised AI opportunity backlog — scored by impact and effort, ranked so the best opportunities (high impact, low effort) are actioned first</li>
                <li>ROI model mapping each opportunity to measurable outcomes</li>
                <li>Strategic AI recommendations with rationale</li>
                <li>Board-ready presentation and business case</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>

          <p class="approach-scope">Deliverable depth scales with your organisation — from targeted backlog to full strategic roadmap.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card approach-card approach-card-featured">
          <div class="approach-header">
            <span class="approach-tag">Process Mining &amp; Live Data</span>
            <p class="approach-context">Best for regulated environments, complex high-volume operations, or when you need evidence — not opinions — to defend your strategy. We connect to your live systems.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="approach-body">
            <div class="approach-section">
              <span class="label-mono">How we work</span>
              <ul class="approach-list">
                <li>Live system integration — ERP, CRM, HRIS, and operational platforms</li>
                <li>Process mining — what's actually happening, not what people say is happening</li>
                <li>Bottleneck identification and inefficiency quantification from real data</li>
                <li>Technology and data readiness assessment against your current stack</li>
                <li>Effort vs impact scoring across all identified opportunities — ranked on a 5-point scale so the highest-impact, lowest-effort items surface first</li>
              </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="approach-section">
              <span class="label-mono">What you receive</span>
              <ul class="approach-list approach-list-deliverables">
                <li>Data-driven process maps drawn from your live systems</li>
                <li>Bottleneck and inefficiency analysis with quantified impact</li>
                <li>Prioritised AI opportunity backlog — scored by impact and effort, ranked so the best opportunities (high impact, low effort) are actioned first</li>
                <li>Quantified ROI projections grounded in your actual operational data</li>
                <li>Process intelligence analysis — specialist consultants implement a process intelligence tool embedded in the engagement, so every recommendation is grounded in your actual system data</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>

          <p class="approach-scope">Platform scope and integration depth scaled to your environment. Proposal scoped after initial conversation.</p>
        </div>

      </div>

      <!-- ── KEYSTONE BANNER ──────────────────────────────────── -->
      <div class="keystone-banner">
        <div class="keystone-banner-copy">
          <span class="section-label">Process intelligence partner</span>
          <h3 class="keystone-banner-title">Powered by Keystone Intelligence</h3>
          <p class="keystone-banner-desc">When process mining is the right approach, we engage Keystone Intelligence — specialist consultants who implement a process intelligence tool to map exactly what's happening inside your systems. Their analysis is the evidence base for every recommendation we make.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ── RIGHT FOR YOU IF ──────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <section class="section section-muted">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="svc-fit-grid">
        <div class="svc-fit-copy">
          <span class="section-label">Is this right for you?</span>
          <h2 class="section-title">Stack Discover is the right starting point if&hellip;</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="card svc-fit-box">
          <ul class="svc-fit-list">
            <li class="svc-fit-item">
              <svg class="svc-fit-icon" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
              <span>You're the CTO or COO who needs to walk into the next board meeting with more than a vendor demo — you need a strategy you can actually defend</span>
            </li>
            <li class="svc-fit-item">
              <svg class="svc-fit-icon" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
              <span>You've had a proof of concept fail, and before you fund the next one, you need to understand what went wrong</span>
            </li>
            <li class="svc-fit-item">
              <svg class="svc-fit-icon" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
              <span>You're operating under regulatory scrutiny — APRA CPS 230 or equivalent — and need validated process documentation before you automate anything</span>
            </li>
            <li class="svc-fit-item">
              <svg class="svc-fit-icon" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
              <span>You want to know what your processes actually look like before committing budget to changing them — not what your team assumes they look like</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ── CTA ───────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <section class="section section-dark-block">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="svc-cta-inner">
        <h2 class="svc-cta-title">Stop guessing. Start with evidence.</h2>
        <p class="svc-cta-desc">Two to eight weeks depending on depth. You walk away with a prioritised backlog tied to real ROI — not a slide deck. If there's no opportunity worth building, we'll tell you that too.</p>
        <p class="svc-cta-note">Stack Discover establishes the process baseline that powers the 30, 60, and 90-day accountability checkpoints across Stack Build and Stack Scale. <a href="/manifesto/" class="svc-cta-note-link">See how the framework works →</a></p>
        <a href="/contact/" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">
          Get Started
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 17L17 7"/><path d="M7 7h10v10"/></svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ── RELATED ───────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="svc-related-header">
        <span class="section-label">The next step</span>
        <h2 class="section-title">Your opportunity is validated. Now build it.</h2>
        <p class="section-desc">Stack Build takes the backlog from Stack Discover and turns it into production AI — scoped, priced, and owned by you.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="svc-related-cards">
        <a href="/services/build/" class="card card-clickable svc-related-card">
          <div class="svc-related-card-tag">
            <span class="badge badge-secondary">Stack Build</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="svc-related-card-title">Stack Build</h3>
          <p class="svc-related-card-desc">Turn your validated opportunity into production AI. Senior engineers, story-point pricing, full IP transfer.</p>
          <span class="svc-related-card-link">
            Learn about Stack Build
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
          </span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>

<style>
  /* ── Hero ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .svc-hero {
    background: var(--gray-1000);
    color: var(--gray-50);
    padding: var(--space-24) 0 var(--space-20);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--gray-800);
  }

  .svc-hero-inner {
    max-width: 56rem;
  }

  .svc-hero-label {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-6);
  }

  .svc-hero-title {
    font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 5.5vw, var(--size-6xl));
    font-weight: var(--weight-800);
    line-height: 1.08;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    text-wrap: balance;
    color: var(--gray-0);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-6);
  }

  .svc-hero-subtitle {
    font-size: clamp(1.125rem, 2vw, var(--size-xl));
    font-weight: var(--weight-500);
    color: var(--gray-400);
    line-height: 1.65;
    max-width: 44rem;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-10);
  }

  .svc-hero-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: var(--space-4);
  }

  /* ── Pain section ─────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .section-pain {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .svc-pain-inner {
    max-width: 52rem;
  }

  .svc-pain-text {
    font-size: clamp(1.125rem, 2vw, var(--size-xl));
    font-weight: var(--weight-500);
    color: var(--foreground);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* ── Differentiator ───────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .svc-diff-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-16);
    align-items: start;
  }

  .svc-diff-stat-group {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-5);
  }

  .svc-diff-stat {
    padding: var(--space-8);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-3);
  }

  .svc-diff-stat-number {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--size-4xl);
    font-weight: var(--weight-800);
    color: var(--primary-text);
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
  }

  .svc-diff-stat-label {
    font-size: var(--size-base);
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .svc-diff-attribution {
    font-size: var(--size-sm);
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
    line-height: 1.65;
    margin: 0;
    padding-left: var(--space-4);
    border-left: 2px solid var(--primary);
  }

  /* ── Approach cards ───────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .approach-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-6);
    align-items: start;
  }

  .approach-card {
    padding: var(--space-8);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-8);
  }

  .approach-card-featured {
    border-color: var(--primary);
  }

  .approach-header {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-4);
    padding-bottom: var(--space-8);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .approach-tag {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--size-sm);
    font-weight: var(--weight-700);
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--primary-text);
  }

  .approach-context {
    font-size: var(--size-base);
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
    line-height: 1.65;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .approach-body {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-8);
    flex: 1;
  }

  .approach-section {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-4);
  }

  .approach-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-3);
  }

  .approach-list li {
    font-size: var(--size-base);
    color: var(--foreground);
    line-height: 1.55;
    padding-left: var(--space-5);
    position: relative;
  }

  .approach-list li::before {
    content: "—";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: var(--border);
    font-weight: var(--weight-700);
  }

  .approach-list-deliverables li::before {
    content: "✓";
    color: var(--primary);
  }

  .approach-scope {
    font-size: var(--size-sm);
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
    line-height: 1.55;
    margin: 0;
    padding-top: var(--space-6);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    font-style: italic;
  }

  /* ── Keystone banner ──────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .keystone-banner {
    margin-top: var(--space-10);
    padding: var(--space-8) var(--space-10);
    background: var(--muted);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--card-radius);
  }

  .keystone-banner-copy {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-3);
    max-width: 56rem;
  }

  .keystone-banner-title {
    font-size: var(--size-xl);
    font-weight: var(--weight-700);
    color: var(--foreground);
    line-height: 1.3;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .keystone-banner-desc {
    font-size: var(--size-base);
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
    line-height: 1.65;
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* ── shared muted background ──────────────────────────────────── */
  .section-muted {
    background: var(--muted);
  }

  /* ── Right for you ────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .svc-fit-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.4fr;
    gap: var(--space-16);
    align-items: start;
  }

  .svc-fit-box {
    padding: var(--space-8);
  }

  .svc-fit-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-5);
  }

  .svc-fit-item {
    display: flex;
    gap: var(--space-4);
    align-items: flex-start;
    font-size: var(--size-base);
    color: var(--foreground);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .svc-fit-icon {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    color: var(--primary);
    margin-top: 2px;
  }

  /* ── CTA band ─────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .section-dark-block {
    background: var(--gray-950);
    color: var(--gray-50);
  }

  .svc-cta-inner {
    max-width: 48rem;
  }

  .svc-cta-title {
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 3.5vw, var(--size-4xl));
    font-weight: var(--weight-700);
    line-height: 1.2;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: var(--gray-50);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  .svc-cta-desc {
    font-size: var(--size-lg);
    color: var(--gray-400);
    line-height: 1.65;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-5);
  }

  .svc-cta-note {
    font-size: var(--size-sm);
    color: var(--gray-500);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-8);
  }

  .svc-cta-note-link {
    color: var(--green-400);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: var(--weight-600);
  }

  .svc-cta-note-link:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  /* ── Related ─────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .svc-related-header {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-8);
  }

  .svc-related-cards {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(22rem, 1fr));
    gap: var(--space-6);
  }

  .svc-related-card {
    padding: var(--space-8);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-4);
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .svc-related-card-tag {
    display: flex;
  }

  .svc-related-card-title {
    font-size: var(--size-xl);
    font-weight: var(--weight-700);
    color: var(--foreground);
    line-height: 1.3;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .svc-related-card-desc {
    font-size: var(--size-base);
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0;
    flex: 1;
  }

  .svc-related-card-link {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-2);
    font-size: var(--size-sm);
    font-weight: var(--weight-600);
    color: var(--primary-text);
    text-decoration: none;
    margin-top: auto;
  }

  /* ── Responsive ──────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .approach-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .svc-hero {
      padding: var(--space-16) 0 var(--space-12);
    }

    .svc-fit-grid,
    .svc-diff-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: var(--space-8);
    }

    .keystone-banner {
      padding: var(--space-6);
    }
  }
</style>
